<title>UK: CRH adds 2.65 bln French francs to June 2006 bond.</title>
<headline>CRH adds 2.65 bln French francs to June 2006 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Caisse Nationale de Credit Agricole.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE DE REFINANCEMENT HYPOTHECAIRE (CRH)</p>
<p> AMT  * 2.65 BLN	COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    06.JUN.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.408    PAY DATE ** 23.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    96.058    SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    * ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED 15.MAY.96 FOR 800 MLN FFR</p>
<p>	   ** PLUS 109 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND APRIL 2006 OAT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
